        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: একেবারে",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "একেবারে — ekebāre — \"completely; absolutely\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "এই রাস্তায় গেলে আমরা একেবারে ঠিক সময়ে পৌঁছাব। ei rāstāy gele āmrā ekebāre ṭhik sômôye poũchhābô. If we take this road, we'll arrive exactly on time."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "একেবারে (ekebāre) is এক, one (CDIAL 2462), with বার, a time or turn, and the Bengali -এ: 'all at one go', so completely. With না it means 'not at all'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
